elped us grow and share this  message across the globe I genuinely  love connecting with our patrons every  month via our private google hangouts  the patreon group chat our exclusive  live streams and more beyond that I'm  amazed and awed at how many of you guys  are connecting with each other and  starting their own blogs or YouTube  channels or just bringing these  conversations to your dinner table so  for those of you who aren't patrons yet  this is your chance to become a producer  of the Reuben report and help us hit our  next goals  so we're serious about growing the show  and fast we'll be starting to do two  interviews per week beginning next week  yep  double the content immediately help us  hit our next goals on patreon and the  show will grow as much as you want it to  everything we're doing at the Rubin  report is because you've enabled us to  continue to do it I hate to sound corny  but you make me a better man speaking of  better people my producer David and my  head of production Amira are seriously  the best team in the business these are  truly the hardest-working people in the  biz and more importantly they never yell  at me for tweeting too much together we  can do this show for a year for roughly  the same cost as one episode of a cable  news show we weren't expecting to make  this move so quickly but the timing  really is perfect the media landscape is  changing so fast and our true  independence will be the key to growing  not only the show but a real political  movement the election is absolute proof  that we need to tackle difficult topics  and controversial ideas honestly most  people don't want the endless fighting  we've become accustomed to but we're the  ones who have to fight to be heard the  most this is my call to action to all of  you not only can you help keep this  message alive but you can help grow it  with no outside influence and with  nothing between us  all right so if you've heard me and you  feel what I feel jump over to 